e evaporation of the world’s oceans.\n\n### 2. Transpiration\n**Process:** Plants absorb water through their roots and release water vapor through pores in their leaves called stomata. This is essentially \"plant sweat.\"\n*   **Key Factor:** Plant activity and humidity.\n*   **Example:** A large forest acts like a giant sponge","tg":256,"tg_seconds":6.762793179,"tg_tok_s":37.85418143422422,"tg_tp_ms":{"add":1.787586597656256,"allreduces":14388,"exchange":2.7169923828125357,"submit":0.028984773437500423,"sum":0.592110460937503,"total":1.1954761367187476,"wait":21.34417144140626},"tg_window_unix":[1791409292.517509,1791409299.2803025],"token_ids":[760,2919,10458,11,1048,3750,430,279,16153,29269,10458,11,369,279,18677,6977,314,2919,383,11,3294,11,321,3559,279,7099,314,279,8964,13,1049,369,264,15346,1817,421,9931,1674,2199,11,76589,9682,11,321,20182,279,17865,13,271,8160,369,264,11346,15673,314,279,2919,10458,11,10548,1441,1083,1141,1328,17102,11,440,1865,29100,9989,364,1754,13,271,13962,220,16,13,10114,92245,198,332,7188,64700,23672,4649,73944,2919,303,51393,11,41713,11,34343,11,321,16665,13,1061,8364,4649,10814,14058,2919,310,2222,1083,2919,36405,318,64,6605,8,321,9704,1083,279,16078,13,198,9,256,2972,1536,36480,64700,35794,13,33088,19274,2895,310,10281,3514,92245,13,198,9,256,2972,12929,64700,1848,264,3882,7094,1834,11,264,52750,273,2047,539,264,10849,25568,58236,888,264,2342,3979,13,561,2919,682,57054,639,1083,279,3594,13,33105,11,279,12401,8421,314,2919,36405,303,279,16078,3905,494,279,3514,92245,314,279,1814,725,51393,13,271,13962,220,17,13,3922,27549,198,332,7188,64700,47544,33170,2919,1472,836,19101,321,4722,2919,36405,1472,68522,303,836,10583,2512,19487,450,13,1061,369,15327,328,20193,26576,1149,198,9,256,2972,1536,36480,64700,17305,5524,321,35863,13,198,9,256,2972,12929,64700,357,3349,13245,13653,1040,264,14120,66035]}
